      "controls": {},
      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Mux (Number) shows one of its four inputs by its Select: 0 is the first, 3 the last. A gear's Ping-pong, times 3, sweeps it up and back down, and in Crossfade mode each picture melts into the next. Set the Mode to Switch and it cuts instead. Drag Select yourself after pulling its cable."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
